WEBVTT
Language: pt-BR

1
00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:03.541 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No vídeo anterior,

2
00:00:03.551 --> 00:00:05.854 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o seu sistema obteve o token de acesso.

3
00:00:05.864 --> 00:00:07.661 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, ele usa esse token para

4
00:00:07.671 --> 00:00:09.900 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
enviar um registro ao HubSaúde.

5
00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:12.040 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Neste vídeo, você entende por

6
00:00:12.050 --> 00:00:14.076 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que o envio acontece em duas etapas,

7
00:00:14.086 --> 00:00:16.184 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
para que serve cada cabeçalho e como

8
00:00:16.194 --> 00:00:19.380 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
repetir um envio sem duplicar o registro.

9
00:00:19.930 --> 00:00:21.273 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Em muitas APIs,

10
00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:23.904 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a resposta ao envio já traz o resultado.

11
00:00:23.914 --> 00:00:24.956 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No HubSaúde,

12
00:00:24.966 --> 00:00:26.985 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o recebimento é confirmado na hora,

13
00:00:26.995 --> 00:00:29.600 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o conteúdo é processado depois.

14
00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:32.106 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Por isso, o envio tem duas etapas.

15
00:00:32.116 --> 00:00:33.994 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Na primeira, o seu sistema envia

16
00:00:34.004 --> 00:00:36.033 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o registro e recebe um comprovante.

17
00:00:36.043 --> 00:00:38.148 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Na segunda, consulta o comprovante

18
00:00:38.158 --> 00:00:40.170 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
até o processamento terminar.

19
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:42.292 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Assim, o seu sistema não mantém a conexão

20
00:00:42.302 --> 00:00:44.900 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
aberta enquanto o conteúdo é conferido.

21
00:00:45.450 --> 00:00:47.343 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Na primeira etapa, o seu sistema faz

22
00:00:47.353 --> 00:00:50.565 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
um POST em /fhir/Patient, com o registro

23
00:00:50.575 --> 00:00:53.560 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
no corpo e cinco cabeçalhos obrigatórios.

24
00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.570 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Authorization leva a palavra

25
00:00:55.580 --> 00:00:57.467 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Bearer e o token de acesso.

26
00:00:57.477 --> 00:00:59.731 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Como o token é vinculado ao certificado,

27
00:00:59.741 --> 00:01:01.241 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a chamada também apresenta

28
00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:03.110 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o certificado de cliente.

29
00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.709 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Content-Type informa que o corpo

30
00:01:05.719 --> 00:01:07.849 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
é um registro FHIR em JSON,

31
00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:11.310 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e Accept pede a resposta no mesmo formato.

32
00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.697 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Prefer: respond-async pede o processamento

33
00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.870 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
assíncrono, em duas etapas.

34
00:01:17.400 --> 00:01:20.250 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Idempotency-Key é um identificador único

35
00:01:20.260 --> 00:01:22.609 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
do envio, gerado pelo seu sistema.

36
00:01:22.619 --> 00:01:25.400 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Mais adiante, você vê para que ele serve.

37
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:27.456 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A falta de qualquer um desses

38
00:01:27.466 --> 00:01:29.969 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
cabeçalhos resulta na resposta 400,

39
00:01:29.979 --> 00:01:31.295 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com um OperationOutcome

40
00:01:31.305 --> 00:01:33.330 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que aponta o problema.

41
00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:35.570 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Quando o envio é recebido,

42
00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.084 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a resposta é 202, sem corpo: o equivalente

43
00:01:39.094 --> 00:01:42.170 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a dizer recebi e vou processar.

44
00:01:42.770 --> 00:01:44.757 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O cabeçalho Content-Location

45
00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:46.384 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
traz o endereço de uma Task,

46
00:01:46.394 --> 00:01:48.011 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
um recurso FHIR próprio para

47
00:01:48.021 --> 00:01:50.590 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
acompanhar pedidos em andamento.

48
00:01:51.140 --> 00:01:53.725 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Já o cabeçalho Retry-After sugere,

49
00:01:53.735 --> 00:01:54.467 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
em segundos,

50
00:01:54.477 --> 00:01:57.200 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
quanto tempo esperar antes da consulta.

51
00:01:57.800 --> 00:01:59.475 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Na segunda etapa, o seu sistema

52
00:01:59.485 --> 00:02:01.527 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
consulta a Task nesse endereço.

53
00:02:01.537 --> 00:02:03.286 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Enquanto o processamento não termina,

54
00:02:03.296 --> 00:02:05.631 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o status é accepted ou in-progress,

55
00:02:05.641 --> 00:02:07.750 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e a consulta se repete.

56
00:02:08.350 --> 00:02:10.102 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O status completed indica

57
00:02:10.112 --> 00:02:11.570 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que o registro foi aceito.

58
00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:14.866 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O campo output aponta o registro criado.

59
00:02:15.380 --> 00:02:18.300 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O status rejected indica recusa.

60
00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.629 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O motivo fica dentro da própria Task:

61
00:02:20.639 --> 00:02:22.808 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o campo statusReason traz um resumo,

62
00:02:22.818 --> 00:02:25.287 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o OperationOutcome, em contained,

63
00:02:25.297 --> 00:02:27.300 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
descreve cada problema.

64
00:02:27.850 --> 00:02:30.050 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, um exemplo do porquê.

65
00:02:30.060 --> 00:02:31.956 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Imagine que a conexão caia logo

66
00:02:31.966 --> 00:02:33.785 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
depois do envio, e o seu sistema

67
00:02:33.795 --> 00:02:36.040 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
não saiba se o registro chegou.

68
00:02:36.050 --> 00:02:37.914 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com uma chave nova, o HubSaúde

69
00:02:37.924 --> 00:02:39.788 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
trataria o envio como outro registro,

70
00:02:39.798 --> 00:02:42.670 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e a informação poderia ficar duplicada.

71
00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:44.919 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Por isso, o sistema repete o envio

72
00:02:44.929 --> 00:02:46.873 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com a mesma Idempotency-Key,

73
00:02:46.883 --> 00:02:49.890 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o HubSaúde reconhece a repetição.

74
00:02:50.030 --> 00:02:51.816 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Se o processamento já terminou,

75
00:02:51.826 --> 00:02:54.136 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a resposta é novamente 202,

76
00:02:54.146 --> 00:02:55.633 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com o mesmo endereço de Task

77
00:02:55.643 --> 00:02:59.029 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o cabeçalho Idempotency-Replayed: true.

78
00:02:59.039 --> 00:03:01.560 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Nenhum registro novo é criado.

79
00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.974 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Se a repetição chega enquanto o original

80
00:03:03.984 --> 00:03:06.012 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
ainda está em processamento, a resposta

81
00:03:06.022 --> 00:03:09.900 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
é 409: aguarde e tente novamente.

82
00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.937 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A chave deve ser gerada uma vez

83
00:03:11.947 --> 00:03:13.144 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
por registro e guardada

84
00:03:13.154 --> 00:03:15.350 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
até a confirmação do resultado.

85
00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.781 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, veja um envio no terminal,

86
00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:19.599 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com o Simulador em funcionamento.

87
00:03:19.609 --> 00:03:21.126 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Se quiser, pause o vídeo

88
00:03:21.136 --> 00:03:23.440 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e execute cada comando junto.

89
00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.281 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Antes do comando principal,

90
00:03:25.291 --> 00:03:27.763 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o terminal prepara algumas variáveis:

91
00:03:27.773 --> 00:03:29.525 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
nomes que guardam valores,

92
00:03:29.535 --> 00:03:30.966 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
para que o comando não precise

93
00:03:30.976 --> 00:03:32.807 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
repetir textos longos.

94
00:03:32.817 --> 00:03:35.224 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A variável TOKEN, criada no módulo 4,

95
00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:37.170 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
guarda o token de acesso.

96
00:03:50.150 --> 00:03:52.602 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Veja as outras duas: a variável

97
00:03:52.612 --> 00:03:54.680 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
CERTIFICADOS guarda as opções

98
00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.710 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
de certificado, e a variável CHAVE guarda

99
00:03:57.720 --> 00:04:01.840 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a Idempotency-Key, gerada com o openssl.

100
00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:03.756 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Com as variáveis prontas,

101
00:04:03.766 --> 00:04:06.436 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
vem o comando principal: o curl envia

102
00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:09.353 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o paciente.json com os cinco cabeçalhos,

103
00:04:09.363 --> 00:04:11.876 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
usando as variáveis no lugar dos valores,

104
00:04:11.886 --> 00:04:13.216 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e grava os cabeçalhos

105
00:04:13.226 --> 00:04:16.730 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
da resposta em cabecalhos.txt.

106
00:04:17.020 --> 00:04:19.072 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
O código exibido é 202:

107
00:04:19.082 --> 00:04:20.670 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o envio foi recebido.

108
00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:22.384 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
A linha seguinte cria mais

109
00:04:22.394 --> 00:04:25.007 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
uma variável de apoio: TASK guarda

110
00:04:25.017 --> 00:04:26.881 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o endereço do Content-Location,

111
00:04:26.891 --> 00:04:28.590 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
para usar na consulta.

112
00:04:28.810 --> 00:04:31.228 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Os cabeçalhos mostram o Content-Location,

113
00:04:31.238 --> 00:04:32.478 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
com o endereço da Task,

114
00:04:32.488 --> 00:04:35.560 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o Retry-After, de 30 segundos.

115
00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:38.020 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Agora, o sistema consulta a Task,

116
00:04:38.030 --> 00:04:41.500 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
usando a variável TASK. O jq é um programa

117
00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.439 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
que filtra a resposta em JSON: aqui, ele

118
00:04:44.449 --> 00:04:47.960 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
exibe apenas os campos status e output.

119
00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:49.152 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Logo depois do envio,

120
00:04:49.162 --> 00:04:50.976 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o status ainda é in-progress,

121
00:04:50.986 --> 00:04:53.160 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o output está vazio.

122
00:04:53.620 --> 00:04:55.128 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Alguns segundos depois,

123
00:04:55.138 --> 00:04:57.444 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
a mesma consulta mostra completed,

124
00:04:57.454 --> 00:05:00.280 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e o output aponta o paciente criado.

125
00:05:00.530 --> 00:05:03.899 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Em resumo: o 202 confirma apenas

126
00:05:03.909 --> 00:05:07.048 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
o recebimento, e o resultado está na Task.

127
00:05:07.058 --> 00:05:09.582 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Os cinco cabeçalhos são obrigatórios.

128
00:05:09.592 --> 00:05:11.886 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
E a mesma Idempotency-Key

129
00:05:11.896 --> 00:05:14.550 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
evita registros duplicados.

130
00:05:15.150 --> 00:05:16.311 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
No próximo vídeo,

131
00:05:16.321 --> 00:05:18.434 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
Envio e acompanhamento pelo terminal,

132
00:05:18.444 --> 00:05:20.191 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
você faz o fluxo completo,

133
00:05:20.201 --> 00:05:22.020 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
repete o envio com a mesma chave

134
00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:24.430 line:-1 position:50% align:center size:80%
e vê um registro recusado.
